msgstr "Each channel will have two volumes: one for the personal mix, which you hear, and one for the stream mix, sent to Stream (Platinum) for your streaming software (OBS, Streamlabs…). The personal mix channels will all play on the same output; Platinum remembers their current outputs and will restore them when you go back to classic mode."

#: ui/ui/app.slint
msgid "Activer"
msgstr "Enable"

#: ui/ui/app.slint
msgid "Revenir au mode classique ?"
msgstr "Back to classic mode?"

#: ui/ui/app.slint
msgid "Plus aucun canal n'est envoyé vers le mix de stream, et chaque canal retrouve la sortie qu'il avait en mode classique. Vos choix de canaux pour les deux mix sont gardés pour la prochaine fois."
msgstr "No channel is sent to the stream mix anymore, and each channel gets back the output it had in classic mode. Your channel choices for both mixes are kept for next time."

#: ui/ui/app.slint
msgid "Revenir au mode classique"
msgstr "Back to classic mode"

#: ui/ui/app.slint
